---
import Service from '../layouts/Service.astro';
---
<Service title="About us" description="About Northfield Heating & Air.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About Northfield Heating &amp; Air</h1>
    <p>Northfield Heating &amp; Air is a fictional company made up to show Nest Co.'s website work. The details here are invented.</p>
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <ul class="checks">
      <li>We explain the problem in plain language.</li>
      <li>You get the price in writing before any work starts.</li>
      <li>We clean up and test before we leave.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What a real page would add</h2>
    <p>A real company would put its licence numbers, real team photos and genuine customer reviews here. This concept site leaves them out rather than invent them.</p>
  </div>
</Service>
